Reference target
----------------
ServerZEN's checks were derived from, and are demonstrated against, MNEMOS — an
independent open-source AI-agent memory runtime by Jason Perlow (ncz-os),
licensed under the Apache License 2.0:

    https://gitlab.com/ncz-os/mnemos

MNEMOS is a separate project. It is NOT included in, vendored by, or part of
ServerZEN; ServerZEN neither claims authorship of it nor redistributes its code.
The accompanying security assessment of MNEMOS is independent review work and
keeps MNEMOS's upstream source unmodified.
